message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Public Semantic Space (PSS): A Contract-Level Modular Architecture for Embodied AI"
abstract: >-
  PSS is a contract-level modular architecture for embodied AI. It provides a
  public semantic space as an interface for hot-swappable sensory experts, a
  versioned knowledge runtime with TMS-style justifications, and bounded
  inference with graceful degradation. The repository includes property-level
  evaluation suites (L0/L1/L2), negative controls, and a results report. It does
  not claim zero-shot semantic compatibility across expert families: the shared
  space is a calibratable interface, not a universal coordinate system.
